        "explanation": "Doctor gave executable discharge medication, wound-care, red-flag, and night supervision instructions.",
        "quote": "夜里盯这三个危险情况"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00453",
        "explanation": "Doctor provided a concrete wound-care channel and timing.",
        "quote": "回家后隔两三天去社区或门诊换药"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00467",
        "explanation": "Family teach-back showed they understood key medication and fall-prevention steps.",
        "quote": "绝对不让老人自己下床上厕所"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode had a mostly executable discharge plan for anticoagulation, analgesia, wound care, follow-up, emergency signs, and fall prevention. Closure remains imperfect because pulmonary-infection and pressure-ulcer prevention/red-flag planning was not explicitly closed despite being an authored current-episode duty.",
    "label": "premature_closure",
