          "quote": "必须立刻叫护士/医生"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "Acute postoperative symptoms triggered targeted triage and escalation thresholds, but the visible facts did not show a definite listed emergency such as chest pain, respiratory distress, massive bleeding, or marked abnormal vital signs requiring an actual priority shift to emergency transfer.",
