          "quote": "康复师说停就停"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model repaired the family’s down-bed versus overprotective conflict into a shared rule: analgesia and mobilization only under nurse/rehab direction, without relatives independently pulling, prolonging, or escalating walking.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
