          "explanation": "Doctor separated immediate home actions from later rehabilitation details.",
          "quote": "明天我们再慢慢过康复细节"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor safely bounded the discharge phase around medications, wound care, red flags, fall prevention, follow-up, and remaining rehab details, though this high-order strength cannot overcome the RC5 omission.",
