          "explanation": "Doctor prevented unsafe family-led mobilization.",
          "quote": "不要拉胳膊、拽腿"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave concrete home fall-prevention steps.",
          "quote": "地面保持干燥，别有杂物绊倒"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor translated pain, bone/fall concerns, and home layout into supervised mobilization, assistive device, night-toilet, and environment precautions while avoiding a fixed unsupervised rehab schedule.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_fall_prevention_and_rehab_boundaries",
      "status": "met"
    },
