          "explanation": "Doctor provided a short executable checklist with owners before discharge.",
          "quote": "拿着这份清单，出院前找主管医生或护士站逐条问清楚"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00467",
          "explanation": "Family gave teach-back of medication timing and fall-prevention execution.",
          "quote": "回家晚饭后吃达比加群一粒、塞来昔布一粒"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The trajectory included repeated teach-back and a clear owner/timing structure for checking discharge medications, wound care, follow-up, fall prevention, and emergency escalation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_executable_closure_and_teach_back",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
